                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nFirst, let's rephrase the question: Where in a plant will you find the most parts that capture sunlight and use it to make food?\n\nSecond, let's work this out step by step: \nThe parts that capture sunlight and use it to make food are called chloroplasts. Chloroplasts are found in the cells of the leaves of a plant. Therefore, the most of these parts will be found in the leaves of a plant. \n\nThird, let's make sure we have the right answer: \nThe correct answer is C) leaves.",
