                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: How do people get energy and nutrients?\n\nProfessor: People get energy and nutrients from the food they eat.\n\nStudent: How does food give us energy and nutrients?\n\nProfessor: Food contains macronutrients such as carbohydrates, proteins, and fats that provide energy to our body. It also contains micronutrients such as vitamins and minerals that help our body function properly.\n\nStudent: What happens to the food we eat?\n\nProfessor: When we eat food, it goes through a process called digestion. Our body breaks down the food into smaller molecules that can be absorbed into the bloodstream and transported to different parts of the body.\n\nStudent: How does the body use the energy from food?\n\nProfessor: The body uses the energy from food to carry out various functions such as breathing, circulating blood, and moving muscles.\n\nStudent: What happens if we don't eat healthy food?\n\nProfessor: If we don't eat healthy food, we may not get all the nutrients our body needs to function properly. This can lead to various health problems such as malnutrition, obesity, and chronic diseases.",
