                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: Professor, I'm having trouble understanding how people get energy and nutrients. Can you help me?\n\nProfessor: Of course! Let's look at the options you have here. Which one do you think is the correct answer?\n\nStudent: I'm not sure, but I think it might be either B) exercising and playing or D) eating healthy food.\n\nProfessor: Good thinking! Let's break it down further. What happens when we exercise and play?\n\nStudent: We burn calories and use energy, right?\n\nProfessor: That's correct! Exercise and play are important for maintaining our health, but they actually use up energy rather than providing it. Now, what about eating healthy food?\n\nStudent: When we eat healthy food, our body breaks it down and absorbs the nutrients and energy it needs.\n\nProfessor: Exactly! So, which option do you think is the correct answer now?\n\nStudent: I think it's D) eating healthy food.\n\nProfessor: That's correct! Eating healthy food provides our bodies with the energy and nutrients we need to function properly. Do you understand how we arrived at this answer?\n\nStudent: Yes, I do. Thank you for helping me work through it step by step, Professor!",
