                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nFirst, we should know that: A food chain is a linear sequence of organisms through which nutrients and energy pass as one organism eats another. A food web is a more complex model that adds more species and more interactions between species. A first-level consumer is an organism that eats primary consumers. A primary consumer is an organism that eats producers. A producer is an organism that makes its own food.\nBased on this, the final answer is D.",
