                        "cot": "Step 1: Identify the substances involved - vinegar (an acid) and ammonia solution (a base).\nStep 2: Determine the reaction between an acid and a base - neutralization.\nStep 3: Match the process with the given options.\n\nThe correct answer is D) neutralization.",
