                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "D) magnitude of charge. Protons and electrons are always equal in terms of the magnitude of charge, with both having a charge magnitude of 1.6 x 10^-19 coulombs.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "",
