                        "cot": "\nThe most likely outcome at the end of the experiment is that both groups will have the same mass with which they started. This is because when water freezes, it expands and when ice melts, it shrinks. So, the group that started with 100 grams of water will end up with less mass than they started with, and the group that started with 50 grams of ice will end up with more mass than they started with.",
