                        "cot": "\nRe-phrased question: What is usually plotted along the y-axis of a graph?\n\nStep 1: The y-axis is usually used to plot a variable.\n\nStep 2: A variable is a quantity that can take on different values.\n\nStep 3: There are two types of variables: independent and dependent.\n\nStep 4: The independent variable is usually plotted on the x-axis, while the dependent variable is usually plotted on the y-axis.\n\nAnswer: C) dependent variables",
